"chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-052-buzhi-complete"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-053-xuezong:line047:m0042","start":42,"end":44,"surface":"吳巨","kind":"person","person_id":"o4w_m9s_2kp","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。","paragraph_id":"c-sanguozhi-053-xuezong:line047","chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-053-xuezong"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-053-xuezong:line047:m0050","start":50,"end":51,"surface":"巨","kind":"person","person_id":"o4w_m9s_2kp","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。","paragraph_id":"c-sanguozhi-053-xuezong:line047","chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-053-xuezong"}],"relations":[],"title_holdings":[{"id":"th-wu052-bz-9","person_id":"o4w_m9s_2kp","title":"蒼梧太守","kind":"office","mode":"attestation","evidence":[{"work_id":"w-sanguozhi","book_id":"b-sanguozhi-052","chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-052-buzhi-complete","source_id":"s-sanguozhi-052-buzhi-complete","paragraph_id":"c-sanguozhi-052-buzhi-complete:line088","quote":"孫權爲討虜將軍，召騭爲主記。除海鹽長，還辟車騎將軍東曹掾。建安十五年，出領鄱陽太守。歳中，徙交州刺史、立武中郎將。領武射吏千人，便道南行。明年，追拜使持節、征南中郎將。劉表所置蒼梧太守呉巨陰懷異心，外附內違。騭降意懷誘，請與相見，因斬徇之，威聲大震。士燮兄弟，相率供命，南土之賓，自此始也。益州大姓雍闓等殺蜀所署太守正昂，與燮相聞，求欲內附。騭因承製遣使宣恩撫納，由是加拜平戎將軍，封廣信侯。","person_mention_id":"c-sanguozhi-052-buzhi-complete:line088:m0092"}],"attestations":[{"id":"th-wu052-bz-9:a","paragraph_id":"c-sanguozhi-052-buzhi-complete:line088","start":88,"end":92,"surface":"蒼梧太守","person_mention_id":"c-sanguozhi-052-buzhi-complete:line088:m0092","usage":"narrative","date_expression":null}],"effective_period":{"start":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]},"end":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]}},"interpretation_note":"本來源官稱或所任，未受另記。","status":"source_attested","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","human_reviewed":false,"model":null},{"id":"t-wu053-t-wu053-xuezong12","person_id":"o4w_m9s_2kp","kind":"office","title":"蒼梧太守","mode":"attestation","status":"source_attested","effective_period":{"start":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]},"end":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]}},"interpretation_note":"本句所載職官，任免時間未詳。","evidence":[{"work_id":"w-sanguozhi","book_id":"b-sanguozhi-053","chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-053-xuezong","source_id":"s-sanguozhi-053-xuezong","paragraph_id":"c-sanguozhi-053-xuezong:line047","quote":"津小檢攝，威武不足，為所陵侮，遂至殺沒。後得零陵賴恭，先輩仁謹，不曉時事。表又遣長沙吳巨為蒼梧太守。巨武夫輕悍，不為恭服。（所取）（輒）相怨恨，逐出恭，求步騭。是時津故將夷廖、錢博之徒尚多，騭以次鋤治，綱紀適定，會仍召出。呂岱既至，有士氏之變。越軍南征，平討之日，改置長吏，章明王綱，威加萬里，大小承風。由此言之，綏邊撫裔，實有其人。牧伯之任，既宜清能，荒流之表，禍福尤甚。今日交州雖名粗定，尚有高涼宿賊；其南海、蒼梧、鬱林、珠官四郡界未綏，依作寇盜，專為亡叛逋逃之藪。若岱不復南，新刺史宜得精密，檢攝八郡，方略智計，能稍稍以漸（能）治高涼者，假其威寵，借之形勢，責其成效，庶幾可補復。如但中人。近守常法，無奇數異術者，則群惡日滋，久遠成害。故國之安危，在於所任，不可不察也。竊懼朝廷忽輕其選，故敢竭愚情，以廣聖思。","person_mention_id":"c-sanguozhi-053-xuezong:line047:m0042"}],"attestations":[{"id":"t-wu053-t-wu053-xuezong12:a","paragraph_id":"c-sanguozhi-053-xuezong:line047","person_mention_id":"c-sanguozhi-053-xuezong:line047:m0042","start":45,"end":49,"surface":"蒼梧太守","usage":"narrative","date_expression":null}],"human_reviewed":false,"reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","model":null}],"address_assertions":[],"table_occurrences":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"preferred_birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-sanguozhi-052-buzhi-complete:line088","text":"孫權爲討虜將軍，召騭爲主記。除海鹽長，還辟車騎將軍東曹掾。建安十五年，出領鄱陽太守。歳中，徙交州刺史、立武中郎將。領武射吏千人，便道南行。明年，追拜使持節、征南中郎將。劉表所置蒼梧太守呉巨陰懷異心，外附內違。騭降意懷誘，請與相見，因斬徇之，威聲大震。士燮兄弟，相率供命，南土之賓，自此始也。益州大姓雍闓等殺蜀所署太守正昂，與燮相聞，求欲內附。騭因承製遣使宣恩撫納，由是加拜平戎將軍，封廣信侯。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","mentions":[{"id":"c-sanguozhi-052-buzhi-complete:line088:m0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"孫權","kind":"person","person_id":"572_278_cba","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-052-buzhi-complete:line088:m0009","start":9,"end":10,"surface":"騭","kind":"person","person_id":"snv_2iq_jes","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-052-buzhi-complete:line088:m0084","start"